/Title (At every position the algorithm considers both possibilities allowed by the encoding scheme: the current digit may be decoded on its own when it is non-zero, and the current digit may be joined with the preceding digit when the resulting value lies between 10 and 26. Invalid two-digit values such as 52 or 35 are rejected by the range test, and zero handling prevents invalid decodings both at the start of the string and in its interior.)
